github.com/ikawaha/graphql

This project is a Go port of graphql-js, the reference implementation of
GraphQL for JavaScript.

    Original work: https://github.com/graphql/graphql-js
    Ported from:   v17.0.2 (commit 9c24501)
    License:       MIT (Copyright (c) GraphQL Contributors)

The original MIT license and copyright notice are retained in LICENSE.

Test material taken from graphql-js, under the same license:

    language/testdata/kitchen-sink.graphql      copied unmodified
    language/testdata/github-schema.graphql     copied unmodified
    validation/upstream_harness_test.go         the validation harness schema,
                                                copied unmodified
    validation/ported_*_test.go                 the validation rule test cases,
                                                translated into Go tables from
                                                src/validation/__tests__
    schema/ported_validation_test.go            the schema validation test
                                                cases, translated from
                                                src/type/__tests__

This is an independent port and is not endorsed by or affiliated with the
GraphQL Foundation or the graphql-js maintainers. Behavior intentionally
diverges from graphql-js in several places; see COMPATIBILITY.md.
